# Ennis, Debate Moderator: Bot1's only other creature is a Spirit token (from Group Project). Ennis exiles it; a token that leaves the
# battlefield ceases to exist, so it does not return at the end step (CR 111.7, 400.7), and a token is not a card (CR 111.1), so
# "one or more cards were put into exile this turn" is false and Ennis gets no counter.

